// 2195_life_cell_murq.cubalc
// Proof 2195: life_cell murq - MurQ anhMurNAc-6-P etherase after AnmK.
// Pay min(n,atp,energy) -> heat+n atp-n energy-n; age/pcr/reserve/pmf/sp/thr held.
// Continuum ...->slt->ampg->nagz->ampd->anmk->murq. Free energy must flow.

REQUIRE VERSION "1.15"
INCLUDE life_cell

ENTITY gate OF Cell 1 40 0
ENTITY poor OF Cell 1 0 0
ENTITY dead OF Cell 0 20 0
ENTITY g0 OF Cell 1 24 0
